<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Wolters Hldg says has 19.39 pct of Goudsmit.</title>
<headline>Dutch Wolters Hldg says has 19.39 pct of Goudsmit.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unlisted Dutch company Wolters Holding BV said on Wednesday it held a 19.39 pct stake in Dutch temporary employment firm Goudsmit.  </p>
<p>Financial holding company Wolters said in November it would cut its stake in Goudsmit to 19.4 percent from 63.9 percent.</p>
<p>The shares were placed at 146 guilders each among institutional investors in the Netherlands and abroad.</p>
<p>Wolters said last month it would retain its remaining stake as a long term investment.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
